window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"ambessa","b":"locke","win":["Ambessa","Ambessa","Ambessa","Ambessa","Ambessa","Ambessa","Ambessa"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Your full chain combo comes online — his one tool to break it is Ashen Pursuit, a flat 10s at every rank."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Public Execution suppresses on arrival — Ashen Pursuit cannot answer it. Your kill window is a cooldown, not hope."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Grievous Wounds is the real spike — Soul Ignition refunds the damage he takes, and anti-heal shuts it."},{"when":"Late","text":"Purgatory executes off the bottom — end fights above its floor, not near it."}],"wants":{"you":["Dash-weave every trade","R him when his E is down","Punish the 10s after his E dash"],"foe":["Land Ritual Nails marks","Poke at Ritual Nails range","Bait you low, then Purgatory"]},"early":"You bully from minute one. Cunning Sweep's double hit beats Ritual Nails at 1, dash damage wins level 2, and level 3's full chain makes every wave a kill threat. Weave dashes so his marked autos never settle, brace with Repudiation, and never sit low — Silver Stake grows with your missing health.","mid":"Level 6 hands you the lever: Public Execution suppresses on arrival, and Ashen Pursuit — his engage and his only exit, a flat 10s at every rank — cannot answer a suppress. Punish the ten seconds after he spends it, dive with R when he hugs turret, and keep every fight above Purgatory's execute floor.","late":"Nothing changes — your mobility and burst are the profile he can't peel. Hunt him in the sidelane and R him the moment Ashen Pursuit's 10s is spent. Public Execution takes the farthest champion in your line, so check nobody stands deeper than Locke before you fire it into a group.","whys":["Ambessa owns level 1 — Cunning Sweep's blade hit beats Ritual Nails chip, so open aggressive and take the trade.","Level 2 stays yours: Ashen Pursuit is his engage AND his only exit — every trade he opens is one-way.","Level 3 is yours outright — Lacerate's slow into the Q cone lands before his 425-range E can reset.","Levels 4-5 keep the boot down: brace Repudiation into his mark cash-in — blocked damage empowers the slam.","Level 6 is Ambessa's — Public Execution suppresses on arrival, and a suppressed Locke cannot E out.","First item keeps you ahead, but buy Grievous Wounds: Soul Ignition refunds part of the damage he takes on an 18s cycle.","Late stays yours — mobility and burst he can't peel. Just end every fight above Purgatory's execute floor; play like it."]});
